      "source_unit_id": "ibn_hajar_isabah_v1:arabic:v08:p0146:fa9112975377feed",
      "arabic": "١١٢٠١- روضة ،\nأخرى: كانت مولاة رسول اللَّه ﷺ. ذكرها محمد بن هارون الرّوياني في مسندة، من طريق سفيان الثوري، عن رجل، عن كريب، عن ابن عباس، قال:\nكان للنّبيّ ﷺ جارية اسمها روضة ... فذكر حديثا طويلا.\nوذكرها ابن سعد والبلاذريّ في موالي النبي ﷺ.",
      "english": "11201—Rawda,\nanother woman: she was a female client of the Messenger of Allah (may Allah bless him and grant him peace). Muhammad ibn Harun al-Ruyani mentioned her in his Musnad, by way of Sufyan al-Thawri, from a man, from Kurayb, from Ibn Abbas, who said:\n\nThe Prophet (may Allah bless him and grant him peace) had a slave-girl named Rawda … He then related a lengthy hadith.\n\nIbn Sa'd and al-Baladhuri also mentioned her among the clients of the Prophet (may Allah bless him and grant him peace).",
      "arabic_sha256": "822bc1e724a8ea3272451110cd8c5f9b464d7d491a524f5318040369859f01c8",
